0082: - A blocker may prohibit one specific operation; it does not park the card. Continue safe in-scope diagnosis, tests, refactoring, evidence collection, or alternative implementation while the exact forbidden operation remains gated.
0083: - Codex does not push, deploy, publish, merge, force-push, delete data, or perform destructive actions without explicit approval.
