0196: - Do not launch two lane orchestrators that can write the same file/hunk or unresolved shared contract.
0197: - Main coordinator remains responsible for global Kanban polling every 1 minute and routing, but must not steal implementation from a live lane orchestrator unless that orchestrator is blocked or dead and the transfer is recorded.
