0620: ## File Ownership and Conflict Policy
0621: 
0622: Before dispatching parallel workstreams, assign file ownership.
0623: 
0624: Rules:
0625: - Two write workstreams must not edit the same file by default.
0626: - If overlap is likely, serialize or make one workstream read-only.
0627: - Shared config/schema/API files create a contract boundary; route or serialize.
0628: - Docs-only streams can run beside code streams if files do not overlap.
0629: - Read-only review, audit, and test-planning streams can run in parallel freely.
0630: - Heavy builds/tests should be sequenced unless cheap and isolated.
0631: - Re-check git status before and after integrating each workstream.
0632: - Never stage unrelated/generated files.
0633: 
0634: Conflict template:
0635: 
0636: ```text
