0787: ## Heartbeat Policy
0788: 
0789: Use short heartbeats at safe boundaries. Heartbeats are not long plans. If ready for review, use the review handoff marker. If blocked, use a blocker report.
0790: 
0791: ```text
0792: COORDINATION HEARTBEAT:
0793: - current task(s):
0794: - state: idle | mapping | parallel_working | working | ready_for_review | blocked | stalled
0795: - active streams:
0796:   - <stream/task>: <state>
