0884: ```
0885: 
0886: After commit:
0887: 
0888: ```powershell
0889: git status --short --branch
0890: git log -1 --oneline
0891: ```
0892: 
0893: Rules:
0894: - Preserve pre-existing dirty state.
0895: - Do not stage unrelated files.
0896: - Do not commit generated junk unless explicitly required.
0897: - If workflow requires commits, every review handoff should include commit SHA.
0898: - If a commit is required and missing, the task is not review-ready.
0899: - If worktree is dirty at start, record it before editing.
