0139: ## Guardrails
0140: 
0141: - Always snapshot before referencing element ids like `e12`.
0142: - Re-snapshot when refs seem stale.
0143: - Prefer explicit commands over `eval` and `run-code` unless needed.
0144: - When you do not have a fresh snapshot, use placeholder refs like `eX` and say why; do not bypass refs with `run-code`.
0145: - Use `--headed` when a visual check will help.
0146: - When capturing artifacts in this repo, use `output/playwright/` and avoid introducing new top-level artifact folders.
0147: - Default to CLI commands and workflows, not Playwright test specs.

