  .hermes\reports\responsive-ui-20260724\s8-evidence.md:132:
  .hermes\reports\responsive-ui-20260724\s8-evidence.md:133:| Finding | Reproduction/evidence | Owning slice |
  .hermes\reports\responsive-ui-20260724\s8-evidence.md:134:|---|---|---|
> .hermes\reports\responsive-ui-20260724\s8-evidence.md:135:| **F-01 — global TopBar overflows 320 px document to 339 
px** | Chromium/WebKit: `clientWidth=320`, `scrollWidth=339`, `.topBarActions` right edge `339.359375`, settings link 
right edge `339.359375`; Firefox right edge `339.48333740234375`. Fails library and protected-shell groups in Chromium 
320, Firefox 320, WebKit 320, and custom Chromium 320×568: 8 cells. | **S6**, ticket `t_e6d36779`; TopBar files may 
require Hermes to extend the S6 rework contract |
  .hermes\reports\responsive-ui-20260724\s8-evidence.md:136:| **F-02 — 568×320 debate content collapses/blocks input** 
| Thread button becomes pressed but `.thread` remains hidden in Chromium, Firefox, and WebKit. In Chromium/Firefox, 
`.scoringInsightsPanel` or its summary intercepts tree-card clicks. Targeted screenshot: 
`s8-targeted-short/screenshots/chromium-short-568x320.png`. | **S3**, ticket `t_befaed4f` (debate chrome and 
scoring-insights presentation) |
  .hermes\reports\responsive-ui-20260724\s8-evidence.md:137:| **F-03 — Firefox 844×390 zoom-to-card is unreachable** | 
After overview-band setup, `.canvasStickyToggle` and `.canvasZoomCluster` intercept the node click. Chromium and 
WebKit pass the same cell. | **S4**, ticket `t_df57cd49` |
  .hermes\reports\responsive-ui-20260724\s8-evidence.md:138:| **F-04 — WebKit 568×320 synthesis/zoom collision** | 
`[data-synth-tab]` intercepts the visible `Reset zoom to 1:1` control; confirmed with a 5-second actionable timeout. | 
**S5** primary, ticket `t_0f877f41`, with S4 collision-owner coordination |
  .hermes\reports\responsive-ui-20260724\s8-evidence.md:139:
  .hermes\reports\responsive-ui-20260724\s8-evidence.md:140:## Browser-floor rendering table
  .hermes\reports\responsive-ui-20260724\s8-evidence.md:141:
  .hermes\reports\responsive-ui-20260724\s8-evidence.md:142:Playwright browser engines and device profiles are 
compatibility evidence, not real installed-browser or hardware product truth.
  .hermes\reports\responsive-ui-20260724\s8-evidence.md:143:
  .hermes\reports\responsive-ui-20260724\s8-evidence.md:257:1. In latest desktop Safari, record macOS/Safari versions 
and open each route at the V-provided QA base: `/`, `/new`, `/settings`, `/admin/workers`, and the completed-tree URL.
  .hermes\reports\responsive-ui-20260724\s8-evidence.md:258:2. Use Responsive Design Mode/window sizing for 320, 375, 
768, 1024, 1440, 2560, 844×390, 568×320, and 507×1024.
  .hermes\reports\responsive-ui-20260724\s8-evidence.md:259:3. On `/`, capture empty, populated, coordinator-error, 
composer-focus, and submit states.
> .hermes\reports\responsive-ui-20260724\s8-evidence.md:260:4. Clear `dialectical:userToken`, then on each protected 
route capture checking, locked, invalid-token, and submitting. Set the valid token and capture the route-specific 
loaded/error states.
  .hermes\reports\responsive-ui-20260724\s8-evidence.md:261:5. On the debate route capture loading, generating, 
completed, error, no-tree, and single-shot IDs. Exercise Thread, Split, Tree, Map; scoring closed/open; Fit, column 
fit, 100%, minimum, maximum, and zoom-to-card.
  .hermes\reports\responsive-ui-20260724\s8-evidence.md:262:6. Open argument detail, challenge/investigation, 
Workspace, scoring diagnostics, guide, synthesis, toast, and expanded unlock dock.
  .hermes\reports\responsive-ui-20260724\s8-evidence.md:263:7. Expected at every cell: no document overflow, no hidden 
selected view, all controls clickable, no mid-word ordinary-English break at 320/375, and no intersection among 
dock/zoom/toast/synthesis rectangles.
  .hermes\reports\responsive-ui-20260724\s8-evidence.md:264:8. Attach full-window screenshots and one interaction 
video for each short-height cell. Any failure returns to its owning slice; it is not waived by Playwright WebKit.
  .hermes\reports\responsive-ui-20260724\s8-evidence.md:265:
  .hermes\reports\responsive-ui-20260724\s8-evidence.md:266:## Final closure statement
  .hermes\reports\responsive-ui-20260724\s8-evidence.md:267:
  .hermes\reports\responsive-ui-20260724\s8-evidence.md:268:The automated matrix, screenshots, traces, handler 
contracts, and acquisition blockers are fully recorded. S8 evidence production is complete, but H9 acceptance is not: 
15 automated product cells fail and all mandatory real pinch/hardware rows remain BLOCKED-ESCALATED for V action.



